      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹2.00. Ex-date: 2nd September 2026 Payment date: 9th October 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.6%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (40% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (363% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 18% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 58% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
